{"ts": "2026-06-12T02:17:36.481721+00:00", "page_id": "p0038", "scope": "line", "target_id": "p0038_catchword_l0001", "field": "notes", "before": "", "after": "This is a signature referencing that this is volume V of Erlington and Todd translation. `C` is the gathering of pages to be bound together. `A` signifies the ending of the first set of pages to be gathered. `B` (on this page) would signifies the second set of pages to be gathered and bound together. And so on.", "reviewer": "Paul Boys"}
